# U5 fail/sema fixture (relocated from origin's cgfail/): a query/insert/update/
# delete that references a column not on the `table struct` is rejected by Sema
# in ALL build modes with a located error (reject, don't coerce). Origin
# validated this at codegen with a non-located cerr; local's Sema is the source
# of truth (a codegen backstop remains).
^[^:]+\.b:[0-9]+:[0-9]+: error: table '[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z_0-9]*' has no field '[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z_0-9]*'$
